Differential Diagnosis CBIR - License and Usage Notice
==========================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains Python source code for a Content-Based Image
Retrieval (CBIR) / reverse image search system developed by Alexandre
Matov, using SIFT/SURF feature descriptors, a bag-of-words model, and
ElasticSearch-based ranking. The code depends on third-party Python
packages that are NOT included in this repository -- see
DEPENDENCIES.md.

